	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08gym0101_veteranm_09_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いかなるときも　うえを　めざす！
まいあがる　ドラゴンの　ように！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-06-15T10:36:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いかなるときも　上を　めざす！
舞いあがる　ドラゴンの　ように！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-09T03:34:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：尻尾にいるトレーナー
・戦闘前メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-09T03:46:58" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>VETERANM
ID：veteranm_09</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-09T03:23:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T08:43:02" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08gym0101_veteranm_09_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>このうえには　おれより　つよい
トレーナーが　まっているぞ▼
みぎは　こうげきじゅうし
ひだりは　ぼうぎょじゅうし▼
さっきの　ドラゴンの　あたまに　もどり
ひかる　さんかくの　うえに　のれ！▽
つぎに　みぎか　ひだりを　えらびな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T06:40:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この上には　おれより　強い
トレーナーが　待っているぞ▼
右には　攻撃重視
左には　防御重視▼
さっきの　ドラゴンの　頭に　戻り
光る　三角の　上に　乗れ！▽
次に　右か　左を　選びな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T06:40:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：尻尾にいるトレーナー
・戦闘後メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-09T03:46:56" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>VETERANM
ID：veteranm_09</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-09T03:31:42" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T08:43:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
