				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>攻撃こそ　すべて！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-09T03:24:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
