	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08gym0101_veteranm_11_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さあ！　シャガさまに　いどめ！▼
こころの　そこから　しょうりを
もとめて　おもうぞんぶん　あばれな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T06:38:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-06-15T10:52:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さあ！　シャガさまに　挑め！▼
心の底から　勝利を
求めて　思う存分　暴れな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T06:38:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-06-15T10:53:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
