			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：右腕トレーナー
・戦闘後メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-09T03:46:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>VETERANM
ID：veteranm_11</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-09T03:33:48" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T08:43:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08gym0101_veteranw_08_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わたくしに　いどむなら
たたかえる　げんきな　ポケモンを▽
３びきいじょう　つれてきなさい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-09T03:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-06-15T10:56:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わたくしに　挑むなら
戦える　元気な　ポケモンを▽
３匹以上　連れてきなさい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
